 the tangent vectors to the grid curves:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf r_u &=\\langle \\frac{\\partial x}{\\partial u},\\,\\frac{\\partial y}{\\partial u},\\,\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial u}\\rangle \\\\  &=\\langle \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial u}\\left(u + v\\right),\\,\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial u}\\left(3 - v\\right),\\,\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial u}\\left(3 u + 5 v + 1\\right)\\rangle \\\\  &=\\langle 1,\\,0,\\,3\\rangle \\\\ \\mathbf r_v &=\\langle \\frac{\\partial x}{\\partial v},\\,\\frac{\\partial y}{\\partial v},\\,\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial v}\\rangle \\\\  &=\\langle \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial v}\\left(u + v\\right),\\,\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial v}\\left(3 - v\\right),\\,\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial v}\\left(3 u + 5 v + 1\\right)\\rangle \\\\  &=\\langle 1,\\,-1,\\,5\\rangle\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the fundamental vector product is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf r_u\\times\\mathbf r_v &=\\begin{vmatrix}i & j & k \\\\ 1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 5\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  &=\\langle \\begin{vmatrix}0 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 5\\end{vmatrix},\\,-\\begin{vmatrix}1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 5\\end{vmatrix},\\,\\begin{vmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{vmatrix}\\rangle \\\\  &=\\langle 3,\\,-2,\\,-1\\rangle\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\left\\|\\mathbf r_u\\times\\mathbf r_v\\right\\| &=\\left\\|\\langle 3,\\,-2,\\,-1\\rangle\\right\\| \\\\  &=\\sqrt{\\left(3\\right)^2+\\left(-2\\right)^2+\\left(-1\\right)^2} \\\\  &=\\sqrt{9+4+1} \\\\  &=\\sqrt{14} \\\\  &=\\sqrt{14}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface area is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\iint_S\\mathrm{d}S &=\\iint_D\\left\\|\\mathbf r_u\\times\\mathbf r_v\\right\\|\\,\\mathrm{d}A \\\\  &=\\iint_D \\sqrt{14}\\,\\mathrm{d}A\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536031 17592186045443 true] [17592186558982 1080 "2 \\sqrt{u + v}" 13194139536031 17592186045443 true] [17592186558982 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139536031 17592186045443 true] [17592186558982 1083 #uuid "6ce6fda6-b951-5d87-8a85-6283f433ac85" 13194139536031 175